  // COMMANDS  [ ▌ ]                                                                                          
                                                                                                              
    LOOK                                                                                                      
    ▸ Overview                                     mcpcardano status                                          
    ◆ Wallets, their limits and what they spent    mcpcardano policy show -wallet <id>                        
    ◆ Approvals waiting                            mcpcardano status                                          
    ◆ Security keys                                mcpcardano key list                                        
    ◆ What the chosen wallet may release           mcpcardano budget pending -wallet <id>                     
    ◆ Ask for the chosen wallet's balance                                                                     
    ◆ Ask how the network is                                                                                  
    ◆ Audit log                                    mcpcardano audit show                                      
    ◆ Verify the audit log's chains                mcpcardano audit verify                                    
    ◆ A recovery waiting                           mcpcardano recover status                                  
    ◆ Check the installation                       mcpcardano doctor                                          
    REDUCE RISK                                                                                               
    ◆ Freeze every wallet                          mcpcardano freeze                                          
    ◆ Freeze the chosen wallet                     mcpcardano freeze -wallet <id>                             
    ◆ Close the chosen wallet's session            mcpcardano session close -wallet <id>                      
    ◆ Reject the chosen approval                   mcpcardano reject <approval_id>                            
    AUTHORIZE                                                                                                 
    ◆ Approve the chosen approval                  mcpcardano approve <approval_id>                           
    ◆ Unlock the wallet                            mcpcardano unlock                                          
    ◆ Register a security key                      mcpcardano key add -name <name>                            
    ◆ Remove the chosen security key               mcpcardano key remove -name <name>                         
    ◆ Start a recovery without keys                mcpcardano recover start                                   
    ◆ Cancel the recovery                          mcpcardano recover cancel                                  
